    "## Data Augmentation\n",
    "* **Model 2:** Deploys shifts, rotations, brightness and contrast\n",
    "* **Model 3:** Deploys noise, blur and JPEG compression\n",
    "* **Model 4:** Combined Model 2 and Model 3"
