    "## The CNN\n",
    "We deploy:\n",
    "* 3x3 convolution (32 channels)\n",
    "* Three stages of two residual blocks (32, 64, 128 channels)\n",
    "* Global average pooling\n",
    "* Linear layer with 4 outputs (about 0.7 million parameters)\n",
    "* Residual block with a skip connection (this makes our deep networks easier to train)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "f8c245ed",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
